        <mxCell id="bVcTVYIVmwyQ1-2vkQ1w-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Observabality&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;There are 3 main signlas that we need to consider&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Logs/Events - Recors the events that happened over time - &lt;b&gt;structured logs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Matrics - Numbers describing a process or activity over a period of time - &lt;b&gt;Matrices API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Traces - Data that shows, for each invocation of a downstream service, which instanace was called, which method within that instance was invoked, how request was performed. - &lt;b&gt;Traces API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
